wait 500
expect Libraries
expect No libraries
expect kobo connect calibre-web
clean
shot libraries
tap Add
expect Library address
expect https://
clean
shot address
type library.example/opds
tap Continue
wait-for Does this library require a username and password?
expect Step 2 of 3
clean
shot account-choice
tap-id sign-in
wait-for Password
expect Step 2 of 3
clean
shot sign-in
# The sign-in form names the computer route too, and Back returns to the
# choice rather than dropping the address.
expect Username
expect Use computer
tap Back
wait-for Use public library
# A public library is saved at once. The sweep has no library at that
# address, so the catalog says it did not answer and offers Try again.
tap Use public library
wait-for Try again
expect did not answer
expect-missing No books or sections
clean
shot public-unreachable
tap Libraries
wait-for https://library.example/opds
expect Open catalog
clean
shot libraries-one
# Nothing downloaded yet says how to download.
tap Downloaded books
wait-for No downloaded books
clean
shot downloaded-empty
tap Back
wait-for Libraries
# The Libraries list shows the library as added, so it must still be there
# after a restart; a library kept only until the app closes is lost silently.
restart
wait-for https://library.example/opds
